    - Category: Contacts
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - People who don't like blob fish (like me lol)
        - Les gens qui aiment pas les blob fish (comme moi lol)
    - Category: Contacts
      Lines:
        keys:
        - EN
        - FR
        values:
        - He always has a cold, yuck!
        - "Il est toujours enrhum\xE9 berk !"
    - Category: Contacts
